        "en": "Evaluate models together with an agent harness — the agent itself becomes an experimental variable. Three forms are distinguished: CLI (launched in a new terminal), desktop app (launches the locally installed client, including MSIX apps), and web/plugin-only (opens the official site). Every entry is detected against the actual machine."
